SUMMARY:Hispanic Heritage Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Old Sugar Mill for a vibrant evening celebrating the richness\, beauty\, and traditions of Hispanic heritage.\nExperience an evening filled with traditional dancing\, lively music\, delicious food\, wine\, culture\, and community — all set against the historic backdrop of Old Sugar Mill.\nCome gather with friends and family as we celebrate the music\, flavors\, traditions\, and spirit that make Hispanic culture so special.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFriday\, October 16 5:00 PM – 9:00 PM\n\n\n\n 
