SUMMARY:SOLO Vintage Goods - Launch Event
DESCRIPTION:SOLO Vintage Goods Boutique Launch in Downtown Winters! \nLaunch of SOLO’s Vintage Goods Boutique and spend the day shopping\, sipping\, snacking\, and supporting local businesses. Browse SOLO’s curated collection of vintage treasures while meeting some of the local businesses joining us for the celebration. \nParticipating Businesses:\nTurkovich Family Wines • Caffecito by Diya • Hourglass Aesthetics & Wellness • Macie Bakes • Roadside Retro Boutique \nExpect vintage finds\, local wine\, coffee\, sweet treats\, boutique shopping\, wellness and beauty\, and plenty of small-town community fun. \nMeet local business owners\, and help us celebrate SOLO’s newest chapter!
