SUMMARY:Living Arts Playback Theatre Ensemble Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Live music at The Melon Ball in Davis \nThe Living Arts Playback Theatre Ensemble is a troupe of improvisational actors and musicians who “play back” personal stories shared by audience members in ways that both honor and illuminate the original experience. \nAbount Playback Theatre – Website Link \nDoors open at 2:00pm \n$25 General Admission\n$20 Seniors (in-store or at the door only)\n$20 Students (w/ID\, in the store or at the door only)\n$20 Kids 12 and under (in the store or at the door only) \nCash or Venmo at the door only (no Credit Card)
