SUMMARY:That Halloween Costume Dance Party feat. The Sugar Pushers Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:That Halloween Costume Dance Party feat. The Sugar Pushers Live @ The Melon Ball in Davis. \nThe Sugar Pushers will de-liver their playfully paranormal themed Rock & Roll and phantasmic antics at Watermelon Music\, Friday\, October 23rd!  Step through the creaking doors of The Melon Ball as it transforms into a Spooktacular Dance Haunt for JUST ONE NIGHT! Come dressed to kill for the Costume Contest\, judged by KDRT’s That California Sound! \nIt will be Ghastly! Ghoulish! and Gloriously over-the-top!  Don’t Ghost this Mischievously Macabre Monster Masquerade! \nAdult Centric / All Ages / 18+ Recommended\nDoors 7:30\nShow 8pm\n$20 General Admission \nCash or Venmo at the door only (no Credit Card) \nThis is a BYOB Event!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/that-halloween-costume-dance-party-feat-the-sugar-pushers-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
